    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'30PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 30.12.20191A\n\nwxl 2156$3 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 30 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'12'30No. 2156/3 - MONDAY, DECEMBER 30, 2019\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nTHE CONSTITUTION OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA\n\nNotification\n\nI, hereby declare that out of the powers and functions vested in me in my capacity as the Minister of Finance, Economicand Policy Development of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, powers and functions specified in the followingSchedule I are delegated to the State Minister of Economic and Policy Development, Hon. John Senevirathna and powersand functions specified in the following Schedule II are delegated to the State Minister of Development Banks and Loans,Hon. Shehan Semasinghe in terms of the provisions of the Article 44(5) of the constitution and the both State Ministershave the opportunity of inquiring, mediating and coordinating all functions coming within the scope of work of the Ministry.\n\nMAHINDA RAJAPAKSE, Minister of Finance, Economicand Policy Development.\n\nMinistry of Finance, Economic and Policy Development,The Secretariat,Colombo 01,30th December 2019.\n\n1A- G 31742 \u2014 370 (01/2020)\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'30PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 30.12.20192A\n\nColumn IColumn IIColumn IIIDuties & FunctionsDepartments, StatutoryLaws and OrdinanceInstitution