ard to the title to parcel of land No. 68 of Block 08 contained in the Cadastral Map No. 520204 situated in the village of Wil-lorawaththa within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 560/61 Willorawaththa East in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Moratuwa in the District of Colombo in the Province of Western published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2139/05 of 11th Septem-ber, 2019. \u201cHectare 0.0257 \u201d mentioned in the column \u201cExtent \u201d is amended as \u201cHectare 0.0275 \u201d\n\nP.M.H. PRIYADARSHANI, Commissioner General of Title Settlement"
