    "chunk_text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'30PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 30.12.20191A\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2156$10 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 30 jeks i\u00f7od - 2019'12'30No. 2156/10 - MONDAY, DECEMBER 30, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\nL.D.B 21/1978(X)(A)\n\nTHE UNIVERSITIES ACT, No. 16 OF 1978\n\nOrder under Section 25A\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Dr. Bandula Gunawardana,the Minister of Higher Education, Technology and Innovation, having obtained a report under Section 70C of the aforesaidAct, in respect of the National School of Business Management Limited, a company incorporated in Sri Lanka under theCompanies Act, No. 7 of 2007 and bearing registration number PB 4833, do by this Order, amend the Order made underthe said Act, and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2053/40 of January 11, 2018, by the repeal of the Schedule Iand II to that Order and Substitution therefor of the following new Schedule I and II as follows :\u2013\n\n\u201cSCHEDULE I\n\nCONDITIONS\n\nNational School of Business Management Limited shall, when admitting students for the degree programmerelating to the degree specified in Schedule II hereto in respect of the Bachelor of Science Engineering Honours inComputer System Engineering, adhere to the minimum entry qualifications of three (3) simple passes (\u2018S\u2019) in PhysicalScience subject stream in one and the same sitting at the GCE (Advance Level) Examination or equivalent.\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A- PG 4836 \u2014 517 (2019/12)"
